where $h$ is the size of support of the kernel function $\zeta^h$, and where $\varepsilon$ and $\Delta s$ are  respectively, the spatial mesh sizes for the transverse variable $\xi\in \mathbb{R}^{d-1}$ and $s\in\RR_+$. 
