\label{thm:main}
Let $(M,g)$ be a complete Riemannian manifold with 
$\mbox{Ric}\geq 0$. Then any biharmonic function $u \in C^4(M)$ of subquadratic growth must be harmonic. In particular, any biharmonic function of sublinear growth must be constant.

